    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just watching my life happen from behind a glass wall. everything that happens to me... it's not even my choice. my family, my work, even the way i talk... it's all just what they expect me to be. i'm so tired of pretending to be someone i'm not just so i don't disappoint people. it feels like i'm suffocating.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly draining to feel like you are living under a glass ceiling while trying to meet everyone else's expectations. Please remember that you deserve to be yourself without the fear of disappointing people.",
